%E A038747 Terms a(12)-a(24) were copied from Table B1, p. 4738, in the paper by Bennett-Wood et al. (1998) (after division by 2) by _Petros Hadjicostas_, Jan 05 2019 [Corrected by _Carlo Corti_, Aug 09 2026]
